A     # So    [36] BOX DRAWINGS DOUBLE HORIZONTAL..BOX DRAWINGS LIGHT DIAGONAL CROSS\n2574..257F;N     # So    [12] BOX DRAWINGS LIGHT LEFT..BOX DRAWINGS HEAVY UP AND LIGHT DOWN```\n","ts":"1618800579.389300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ye9q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09706554-475a-44b3-8a82-874fc006b071","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"Unicode とかフォント周りは本当にややこしい…","ts":"1618800348.388700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pnc5j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12051a26-3bef-4040-ab9d-f650bcca343c","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"GitHub issue 全般というより、ambiwidthなにもわからんというお気持ち","ts":"1618793495.388100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h59OF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c64236c8-b3dd-420b-b7cc-caee06d95178","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"議論なんだから多少間違ったやつがいてもいいだろぐらいのお気持ちでいます","ts":"1618783692.387400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zar"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cc08645-e218-4fed-b39c-d07632044be2","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"間違ってたら無視されるだけだから良いんじゃないですか？","ts":"1618783670.386900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QJHlA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38ee1314-6c7c-4641-ae82-052d2b5edd03","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"コメントしておいてなんだけど、いつも理解が合ってるのか心配になる。","ts":"1618758911.386400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T6LK"}]}]
